Neovim Tutor: 04 VISUAL MODE

Goal
  Select and operate on blocks of text.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Visual types
  v   char-wise visual
  V   line-wise visual
  <C-v> block-wise visual

Practice:
  - Select a word with v and move to expand.
  - Select a few lines with V.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Visual actions
  d   delete selection
  y   yank selection
  c   change selection
  >   indent right
  <   indent left

Practice:
  - Select some lines and indent them with >.
  - Undo with u.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 3: Column edit
  <C-v> to select a column
  I       insert at start of block (then <Esc>)
  A       append at end of block (then <Esc>)

Practice:
  - Use block mode to add "# " to several lines.
  - Undo when done.

End of lesson 04.
